## 🧪 Benchmark Example

This project includes a simple benchmark to measure execution time of a loop operation in D.

### Code Example
```d
import std.stdio;
import std.datetime;

void main()
{
    auto start = Clock.currTime();

    long sum = 0;

    foreach (i; 0 .. 1_000_000)
    {
        sum += i;
    }

    auto end = Clock.currTime();

    writeln("Sum: ", sum);
    writeln("Time taken: ", end - start);
}

## 📊 Benchmark Explanation

The project demonstrates how performance can be measured using the D programming language.

- A loop is executed 1,000,000 times
- Execution time is recorded using `std.datetime`
- The result helps analyze performance efficiency

This forms the basis for identifying bottlenecks and optimizing the Phobos standard library.

